          "answer": "$1<x<3$, $x\\neq 2$"
        },
        {
          "q": "Bereken die som tot oneindig van die reeks as $x=2{,}5$.",
          "marks": 2,
          "solution": [
            "$a=r=0{,}5$, dus $S_\\infty=\\dfrac{a}{1-r}=\\dfrac{0{,}5}{1-0{,}5}$",
            "$S_\\infty=1$"
          ],
          "answer": "$S_\\infty=1$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
